<!--
  Info.plist keys required by the native plugins this app bundles.

  Apple REJECTS apps that touch the camera or photo library without a purpose
  string. After `npm run cap:add:ios`, paste these <key>/<string> pairs into the
  top-level <dict> of `ios/App/App/Info.plist` (edit the copy text as you like —
  the review team reads them verbatim).

  Required by @capacitor/camera:
-->
<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
<string>SteelBuild Pro uses the camera to capture jobsite and delivery photos and attach them to your projects.</string>
<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
<string>SteelBuild Pro lets you attach photos from your library to RFIs, deliveries, and field reports.</string>
<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
<string>SteelBuild Pro saves exported reports and photos to your photo library when you choose to download them.</string>

